        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sleep disturbance"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Poor sleep for approximately 9–12 months, worse over the last 3–4 months. Takes 60–90 minutes to get to sleep, then wakes 3–4 times per night on most nights, often drenched in sweat. Averages approximately 4–5 hours of fragmented sleep and wakes unrefreshed."
      }
    },
